    "detailed_description": "<strong>Story</strong><br>To protect the village from the purple animals that try to eat it like a packed lunch, our animal friends stood up with their guns.<br>Fight your enemies right now with supplies falling from the sky and achieve them. Only! Blood thirst and ruthlessness for survival!<br>Win the battlefield and survive!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game function</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>You can purchase items from the shop.<br></li><li>You can enhance items in the Helster Forge.<br></li><li>Save money in the bank and earn interest to get stronger.<br></li><li> Collect set items to enjoy stronger effects.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Character introduction</h2>Our pink-ass Ping Tong is the first intrepid rabbit to take a gun to defend the village.<br>Please play with love.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Discord</h2>Come here to communicate. ",
